<p>Fill-in digipeaters provide local, first-hop-only coverage in areas that can't reliably reach a mountaintop WIDEn-N digipeater — valleys, urban areas, and other RF-shadowed spots.</p>

<p>See <a href="/widen-n-digipeater/" class="text-signal-600 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-signal-500">WIDEn-N Digipeater</a> for the wide-area digipeater configuration this complements.</p>
